@startuml
top to bottom direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #4A5568
skinparam ArrowFontSize 10
skinparam nodesep 26
skinparam ranksep 42
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #F7FAFC

title Событийный поток: transactional outbox → Kafka → consumers

package "conversation (владелец данных)" {
  component "Домен\nmessage + chat" as domain #2B6CB0
  component "ops.outbox\n(в БД сервиса)" as outbox #2B6CB0
}

component "Outbox relay\n(SKIP LOCKED)" as relay #4A5568
queue "Kafka\nkrug.message.v1" as topic #B7791F
component "DLQ\nkrug.message.v1.dlq" as dlq #C53030

package "Consumer groups" {
  component "realtime\nfan-out по устройствам" as rt #2F855A
  component "extensions\nbot events" as ext #2F855A
  component "notification\nin-app / push" as notif #2F855A
  component "search\nmanaged index" as search #2F855A
  component "audit\nappend-only" as audit #2F855A
  component "admin\nCQRS read model" as admin #2F855A
}

domain --> outbox : INSERT в той же транзакции
outbox --> relay : polling / CDC
relay --> topic : publish (at-least-once)
topic --> dlq : poison / N попыток
topic --> rt : message.created
topic --> ext : message.created
topic --> notif : message.created
topic --> search : managed only
topic --> audit : audit envelope
topic --> admin : projection

note right of topic
  **Контракт события**
  • event_id (UUID), type, version
  • workspace_id, aggregate_id
  • partition_key = chat_id / workspace_id
  • trace_id, occurred_at
  • payload без plaintext и секретов
  Дедуп у консьюмера по event_id.
end note

note bottom of rt
  E2EE: событие несёт только флаг e2ee.
  Конверты на устройство realtime
  запрашивает у conversation batch-ом,
  чтобы не раздувать Kafka и не
  рассылать чужие конверты.
end note

note bottom of admin
  Тот же паттерн для identity.v1,
  workspace.v1, chat.v1, media.v1,
  plugin.v1, realtime.v1.
  Полная матрица — EVENTS.md.
end note

@enduml
